&lt;p&gt;To learn how we process your personal data during the recruitment process, please refer to our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vonage.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vonage is a global cloud communications leader. And your talent will further help brands - such as Airbnb, Viber, WhatsApp, and Snapchat - accelerate their digital transformation through our fully programmable-based unified communications, contact center solutions, and communications APIs. Ready to innovate? Then join us today.&lt;/p&gt;
